{"data":{"body":"[P1] Add a finite request timeout here and to `OpenSearchExporter`. These JDK HTTP requests can wait indefinitely after connecting, and `onInvocationEnd()` drains exporter workers, so a stalled peer can force repeated Lambda timeouts. Add validated timeout options and apply `HttpRequest.timeout()` to both exporters.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7uFD1g","finding_digest":"67ad3a262996d23846e945e04f7825c1c6d34ef717e33f2fbb5580687dbed696","finding_id":"arf_v1_m6wtujrjs3jdqrxjixqe66bfyh","finding_key":"insight-plugin/http-exporters::send::bounded-invocation-lifetime","identity_key":"insight-plugin/http-exporters::send::bounded-invocation-lifetime","line":98,"observation_digest":"2c4705946a266c018b7898156453c8e73dd82c3038535ed4b0a3084d5ca50a0a","observation_id":"aro_v1_frdqlfdkezwadc3ytakwiu6i44","path":"insight-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/exporters/OTelExporter.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_m6wtujrjs3jdqrxjixqe66bfyh","published_at":"2026-09-11T23:59:23Z","review_id":"arr_v1_dsz4gv2uaenyehudpwq7ak7gfu","reviewed_base_sha":"7f1a73ca16308d31a1e5a270e504676caf890e0b","reviewed_head_sha":"31041e66099621f3132e1db1765a716c2d304296","reviewer":"codex","start_line":96,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":704},"record_id":"art_v1_fvm6iopecmzdr2bpblgor7mali","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-11T23:59:23Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
